From 84073db393d1e8bc0bc807944d62cb6a6e65f305 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Syed Naqvi <syed.naqvi@nooralnibras.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Mar 2026 16:21:06 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(rtl): full RTL support for Sidebar, Card,
 GlassEffectWrapper, Dialog

- Sidebar stories: decorator passes isRtl from nbsDirection globals
- GlassEffectWrapper: new stories (Shine, Perfume, PerfumeRandomHue) with RTL
- Dialog stories: pass isRtl from context to Dialog component
- Sidebar.module.css: RTL layout rules for border, groupItem padding
- Card.module.css: RTL layout rules for headerActions, footer, badges

Made-with: Cursor
